*  ⛔ THE MIRROR-IMAGE WITNESS, AND THE PROOF OF THE MECHANISM -- deliberately carries NO .ref.
*  The unsafe LEN is written FIRST, so the ORACLE evaluates it first and raises ERROR 121, while
*  pre-fix SCRIP evaluated the guard first, failed cleanly, and printed 'nomatch' -- a divergence in
*  the OPPOSITE direction from its sibling.  ONE root cause, TWO mirror-image wrong answers.
*  POST-FIX both engines raise Error 121, i.e. SCRIP is now correct.  ⛔ NO .ref ON PURPOSE: the
*  residual text difference is the two engines' ERROR-REPORT FORMAT (SPITBOL prints a file(line)
*  banner plus a dump; SCRIP prints '** Error N in statement M'), a separate GLOBAL divergence that
*  this witness must not silently pin.  Graded by reading, named in the FINDING, never scored.
        A = 0
        'abcdef'       LEN(A - 10) GT(A, 0)                :S(M)F(NM)
M       OUTPUT = 'matched'                                 :(DONE)
NM      OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
DONE    OUTPUT = 'end'
END
